\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1.\cf0  God shall surely do it;
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 I with all my worries,
\par Put into His care.
\par He chose me by His will,
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par E'en before I was born
\par Into this our world,
\par In accordance with His will
\par He makes provision for my needs
\par While I live in this world,
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  2. God shall surely do it;
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 He has made me happy
\par And I'm satisfied.
\par He will not forget me,
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par My clothing and my food,
\par He provides them all.
\par It is He who gives relief
\par When the weighted cross that I bear
\par Gets too heavy for me.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  3. God shall surely do it;
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 Let the thunder rambles,
\par And tempest still high,
\par Let the oceans roll on;
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par And rage on fiercely,
\par He shall be with me.
\par Jonah spent three days within;
\par Therefore when you are in trouble,
\par The Lord does sustain you.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  4.  God shall surely do it;
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 In your desperate moments,
\par He values and sees.
\par If you should be frightened
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par In the course of troubles,
\par He will be by you.
\par It's your Lord who will save you;
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0\qj Therefore all your fears shall be moved,
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 As it does with the clouds.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  5.  God shall surely do it;
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0  That he who is too soft
\par \pard\li315\sl190\slmult0 Shall get multiplied.
\par And within God's lovers,
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par How many did perish
\par Through tribulation?
\par Do not think of your problems
\par Ev'rything is in the Lord's hands;
\par And His will is perfect.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-270\li315\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 6\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  6.  God shall surely do it;
\par \pard\li315\sl190\slmult0 Unrelenting, grim death
\par Surely, is at work.
\par Should your death be early;
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par During your days of life
\par He will raise your soul.
\par And take you into heaven,
\par Thus, even your mortal body
\par Will not suffer decay.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-315\li315\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 7\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par   7. It is God who'll do it
\par \pard\li315\sl190\slmult0 He has conquered Satan,
\par And his power destroyed.
\par Children of the Lord God
\par Walk along the dark path
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par With amazing grace.
\par Whether joy or sorrow
\par All depends upon His power,
\par The Lord God will make it!
\par \pard\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2\fs14 
\par }

